  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Calculate the standard cell potential (in V) of the cell in which the following reaction takes place:</p><p><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Given that<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
