  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> of cathode <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> of anode<br /><math><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup></math></p><p>Since <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math> cell is an intensive property, the <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math> cell values are not additive by nature. But the standard Gibbs free energy change is an extensive property and hence can be added.</p><p>(i) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>z</mi></math></p><p>(ii) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Subtracting (ii) from (i)<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math></p>",
